{"seq":3,"slug":"systems-biology","title":"研究生 分子生物学 — 系统生物学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/molecular-biology-grad/cell-signaling/systems-biology","wordCount":1429,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-分子生物学-系统生物学\">研究生 分子生物学 — 系统生物学</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>系统生物学是一种整合性的研究范式，它不再孤立地研究单个基因或蛋白质，而是从网络和系统的角度理解生命现象的涌现性质。通过组学数据（基因组、转录组、蛋白质组、代谢组）的整合分析和数学建模，系统生物学试图揭示基因调控网络、信号通路和代谢网络的全局组织原则和动态行为。</p>\n<p>核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>基因调控网络（GRN）</strong>：转录因子与靶基因之间的调控关系网络</li>\n<li><strong>网络模体（Motif）</strong>：网络中反复出现的小规模连接模式</li>\n<li><strong>布尔网络与 ODE 模型</strong>：基因网络动力学的数学描述</li>\n<li><strong>多组学整合</strong>：跨层次数据（DNA→RNA→蛋白质→代谢物）的联合分析</li>\n<li><strong>合成生物学</strong>：人工设计和构建生物系统</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"网络生物学基础\">网络生物学基础</h3><p><strong>网络表示</strong>：生物系统可以用图论描述——节点（基因、蛋白质、代谢物）和边（调控、相互作用、化学反应）。</p>\n<p><strong>网络拓扑特征</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>生物学意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>度分布</td>\n<td>节点连接数的分布</td>\n<td>无标度网络：少数&quot;枢纽&quot;基因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚类系数</td>\n<td>邻居之间的连接程度</td>\n<td>功能模块化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路径长度</td>\n<td>节点间最短路径</td>\n<td>信号传递效率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中心性</td>\n<td>节点的全局重要性</td>\n<td>必需基因预测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>无标度网络</strong>：大多数生物网络的度分布服从幂律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∼</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(k) \\sim k^{-\\gamma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，少数高度连接的枢纽节点（如 p53、TP53）对网络功能至关重要。</p>\n<h3 id=\"网络模体与调控逻辑\">网络模体与调控逻辑</h3><p><strong>前馈环路（Feed-Forward Loop, FFL）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>C</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\to B \\to C, \\quad A \\to C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一致性 FFL（coherent type 1）：A 同时直接和间接激活 C → 延迟开关（过滤噪声）。</p>\n<p><strong>负反馈环路</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>⊣</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\to B \\dashv A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>产生振荡行为，如 p53-Mdm2 的脉冲式响应。</p>\n<p><strong>双稳态开关</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>⊣</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>B</mi><mo>⊣</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\dashv B, \\quad B \\dashv A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>相互抑制产生两个稳定状态（如细胞命运决定中的 A/B 二选一）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"动力学建模\">动力学建模</h3><p><strong>ODE 模型</strong>（常微分方程）：用于描述分子浓度的连续变化。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mtext>prod</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>K</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mtext>deg</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{d[X]}{dt} = k_{\\text{prod}} \\cdot \\frac{[A]^n}{K^n + [A]^n} - k_{\\text{deg}} \\cdot [X]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prod</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">deg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Hill 函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>K</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{[A]^n}{K^n + [A]^n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.53em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5935em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\"><span class=\"mclose mtight\">]</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5935em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\"><span class=\"mclose mtight\">]</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7385em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 描述了转录因子对靶基因的协同激活（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时为超灵敏响应）。</p>\n<p><strong>随机模拟</strong>：细胞内分子数量有限时（如转录因子拷贝数 &lt;100），确定性 ODE 失效，需要 Gillespie 算法进行随机模拟。</p>\n<p><strong>布尔网络</strong>：将基因状态简化为 0（关）/1（开），用逻辑规则（AND、OR、NOT）描述调控关系。适用于大规模网络的定性分析。</p>\n<h3 id=\"多组学数据整合\">多组学数据整合</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组学层次</th>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>测量内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基因组</td>\n<td>WGS, WES</td>\n<td>DNA 序列变异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表观基因组</td>\n<td>ChIP-seq, ATAC-seq</td>\n<td>组蛋白修饰、染色质可及性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转录组</td>\n<td>RNA-seq, scRNA-seq</td>\n<td>mRNA 表达水平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蛋白质组</td>\n<td>LC-MS/MS</td>\n<td>蛋白质丰度和修饰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代谢组</td>\n<td>LC-MS, GC-MS</td>\n<td>代谢物水平</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>整合策略</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>相关网络：计算不同层次数据之间的统计关联</li>\n<li>因子分析：多组学因子分析（MOFA）识别跨层次的变异因子</li>\n<li>因果推断：Bayesian 网络推断因果关系方向</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"合成生物学\">合成生物学</h3><p><strong>理念</strong>：像工程学设计电路一样设计生物系统。</p>\n<p><strong>经典案例</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>基因振荡器（Repressilator, 2000）</strong>：三个相互抑制的转录因子形成环路 → 蛋白质浓度振荡</li>\n<li><strong>基因开关（Toggle Switch, 2000）</strong>：两个相互抑制的基因 → 双稳态行为</li>\n<li><strong>基因逻辑门</strong>：AND、OR、NOT 等逻辑操作的生物实现</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>前沿应用</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CAR-T 细胞工程（合成免疫学）</li>\n<li>基因回路用于代谢工程（生产生物燃料、药物前体）</li>\n<li>活细胞传感器（检测环境污染物、疾病标志物）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>对一个一致性前馈环路（C1-FFL），用 ODE 模型模拟其对短暂脉冲信号和持续信号的不同响应。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>解释为什么生物网络的无标度拓扑使其对随机故障鲁棒但对靶向攻击脆弱。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个基因振荡器（提示：需要负反馈和适当的时间延迟）。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>讨论单细胞多组学技术（如 SHARE-seq、10x Multiome）如何改善我们对细胞异质性的理解。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较确定性 ODE 模型和随机 Gillespie 模拟在预测低拷贝数基因行为上的差异。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Alon《An Introduction to Systems Biology》是系统生物学最受欢迎的入门教材。</li>\n<li>Barabási &amp; Oltvai (2004) &quot;Network biology: understanding the cell&#39;s functional organization&quot; 是网络生物学的经典综述。</li>\n<li>Elowitz &amp; Leibler (2000) &quot;A synthetic oscillatory network of transcriptional regulators&quot; 是 Repressilator 的原始论文。</li>\n<li>Regev, Teichmann 等人的单细胞图谱项目正在用系统生物学方法绘制人体细胞类型的全景图。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>系统生物学通过网络视角和数学建模理解生命系统的涌现性质。网络模体（前馈环路、反馈环路、双稳态开关）是生物网络的基本计算元件，ODE 和随机模型揭示了这些模体的动力学行为。多组学数据的整合使我们能够跨越从 DNA 到代谢物的多个层次理解细胞状态。合成生物学则将系统生物学的知识转化为设计和构建人工生物系统的工程实践。这种&quot;理解→预测→设计&quot;的路径正在使生物学从描述性科学走向定量化和可工程化的新阶段。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 分子生物学 — 系统生物学","id":"研究生-分子生物学-系统生物学"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"网络生物学基础","id":"网络生物学基础"},{"level":3,"text":"网络模体与调控逻辑","id":"网络模体与调控逻辑"},{"level":3,"text":"动力学建模","id":"动力学建模"},{"level":3,"text":"多组学数据整合","id":"多组学数据整合"},{"level":3,"text":"合成生物学","id":"合成生物学"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 分子生物学 — 受体生物学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/molecular-biology-grad/cell-signaling/receptor-biology"},"next":{"title":"研究生 分子生物学 — CRISPR 基因编辑","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/molecular-biology-grad/techniques/crispr-gene-editing"}}